WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.181 --> 00:00:01.153
- 2016 just started,

00:00:01.153 --> 00:00:02.906
but there's already a
brand-new viral trend.

00:00:02.906 --> 00:00:04.184
It's called CD glasses flipping.

00:00:04.184 --> 00:00:05.347
Do you know about it?

00:00:05.347 --> 00:00:06.195
- No.

00:00:06.195 --> 00:00:10.987
(funky techno music)

00:00:10.987 --> 00:00:12.101
- So what you do,

00:00:12.101 --> 00:00:13.543
you put them on like this.
^- [Tyler] And then like?

00:00:13.543 --> 00:00:15.309
- And then go like that.

00:00:15.309 --> 00:00:16.321
And then like that.

00:00:16.321 --> 00:00:17.389
- Oh, I got this.

00:00:17.389 --> 00:00:18.314
- This is a thing?

00:00:18.314 --> 00:00:19.417
- Oh, yeah!

00:00:19.417 --> 00:00:21.170
(yelling)

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:22.529
- He's lying. He's making that up.

00:00:22.529 --> 00:00:23.755
We didn't do that, we didn't do that!

00:00:23.755 --> 00:00:24.491
- Just like this?

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:25.012
- Yeah.

00:00:25.012 --> 00:00:27.168
Then just tilt your
head back a little bit.

00:00:27.168 --> 00:00:27.868
There you go, yeah!

00:00:27.868 --> 00:00:29.543
And then forward
(mic cracks)

00:00:31.583 --> 00:00:32.549
- How'd that go?

00:00:32.549 --> 00:00:34.598
- I got this.

00:00:35.958 --> 00:00:38.513
(chuckles) I don't got it.

00:00:38.513 --> 00:00:39.534
- Hey!

00:00:39.534 --> 00:00:41.266
- And then forward.

00:00:41.266 --> 00:00:41.714
- Boom!

00:00:41.714 --> 00:00:42.972
(groans)

00:00:42.972 --> 00:00:44.075
- What, what!?

00:00:44.075 --> 00:00:44.919
- Oh, wow.

00:00:44.919 --> 00:00:45.732
Flip your head back.

00:00:45.732 --> 00:00:46.385
(squeals)

00:00:46.385 --> 00:00:47.024
- I broke it!

00:00:47.024 --> 00:00:47.846
- [Christian] You did so great!
- [Neil] Oh my God.

00:00:47.846 --> 00:00:48.960
- And they open.

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:49.855
- [Zach] Yes!
- [Maggie] What!?

00:00:49.855 --> 00:00:52.422
- I see you, peek-a-boo!

00:00:52.774 --> 00:00:54.139
- And back!

00:00:57.109 --> 00:00:58.523
- Maybe.

00:00:59.152 --> 00:01:00.796
- [Christian] Oh no, he
should be first, all right.

00:01:00.796 --> 00:01:01.962
(digital beep)

00:01:01.962 --> 00:01:03.270
- What do you think about this as a trend?

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:04.961
- I think it's awful.

00:01:04.961 --> 00:01:06.319
- Right, well thanks for your time.

00:01:06.319 --> 00:01:06.957
We appreciate it.

00:01:06.957 --> 00:01:08.234
- [Neil] This is what I've
been waiting for all night.

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:09.171
This is the reason why I came

00:01:09.171 --> 00:01:10.192
to the People's Choice Awards,

00:01:10.192 --> 00:01:11.807
so I could do this.

00:01:11.807 --> 00:01:13.365
- Muah!

